flowchart LR
    U[Usuario web] --> FE[Frontend React]
    FE --> API[API .NET 10]
    API --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
    API --> S3[(Storage cifrado)]
    API --> KMS[Vault ou KMS]
    API --> OUT[(Outbox / Fila)]
    OUT --> WRK[Workers de Sync / Import]
    WRK --> GW[Gateway Edge]
    GW <-->|HTTPS na LAN| DEV[Terminais Control iD]
    DEV -->|Monitor / Push / Pro| GW
    GW --> ING[Receptor de eventos]
    ING --> OUT
    FILE[ZIP, CSV ou pacote cifrado] --> API
    API --> OBS[Auditoria + Observabilidade]
    WRK --> OBS
